                  "description": "Diagnostic profiling (^SystemPerformance / pButtons), lock deadlock resolution, and shared memory/buffer tuning for InterSystems IRIS."
                }
              },
              {
                "@type": "Offer",
                "itemOffered": {
                  "@type": "Service",
                  "name": "Legacy Modernization & Fractional Support",
