                  "description": "Contract engineering for HL7 FHIR®, DICOM routing at scale, OHDSI OMOP evidence generation, and Analytics on FHIR with BigQuery."
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "WebSite",
          "@id": "https://www.integrationrequired.com/#website",
          "url": "https://www.integrationrequired.com",
          "name": "Integration Required",
          "description": "Ron Sweeney — Named Technical Interoperability Engineer and InterSystems Implementation Partner specializing in InterSystems Kubernetes Operator (IKO), HA mirroring, and cloud-native healthcare data platforms.",
          "publisher": {
            "@id": "https://www.integrationrequired.com/#organization"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- Skip-to-content: first focusable element on the page.
         Hidden until keyboard-focused so sighted users never see it.
         Screen readers and keyboard users tab to it and jump past the nav. -->
    <a href="#main-content" class="skip-to-content">Skip to content</a>

    <Navbar />
    <main id="main-content">
      <slot />
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
